WEBVTT

00:06.380 --> 00:07.840
What is this?

00:08.480 --> 00:09.930
Everyone get outside!

00:12.010 --> 00:13.350
I've come to visit.

00:15.360 --> 00:18.080
D-Demon Lord?

00:18.510 --> 00:22.040
Ike, you need to head back now.

00:23.620 --> 00:25.670
Cefiro is in danger.

00:37.670 --> 00:39.390
Fire!

00:44.310 --> 00:49.600
Cefiro conquered Alesta, but it was a trap.

00:49.600 --> 00:50.190
A trap?

00:50.680 --> 00:57.340
The enemy lured her inside the 
castle and then surrounded her.

00:58.640 --> 00:59.580
How many are there?

01:00.540 --> 01:02.000
Around 5,000.

01:02.620 --> 01:04.070
There is very little time.

01:05.010 --> 01:08.580
I've done what was needed to 
get your brigade ready to deploy.

01:09.500 --> 01:12.460
You must be the one to save Cefiro.

02:44.510 --> 02:49.020
<i>Cefiro Is Defeated</i>

02:54.770 --> 02:59.170
General E Rudle, Alesta will fall soon.

02:59.170 --> 02:59.850
All right.

03:00.530 --> 03:02.220
It's time for me to go myself.

03:02.220 --> 03:02.660
Yes, sir!

03:20.890 --> 03:22.470
Push them back!

03:52.200 --> 03:55.270
Tough, for a demon.

03:55.270 --> 03:57.750
But you're finished.

03:59.110 --> 04:00.780
<i>Cefiro-sama...</i>

04:15.350 --> 04:17.100
Huh? Here?

04:17.100 --> 04:19.090
We're back?

04:19.090 --> 04:19.760
Yes.

04:20.240 --> 04:23.570
Teleportation magic sure is convenient.

04:26.260 --> 04:27.920
Which means...

04:27.920 --> 04:32.560
Master, can you travel 
between here and Xenobia?

04:32.560 --> 04:34.220
That's correct.

04:35.500 --> 04:38.650
And the betrothal was finally postponed, too.

04:38.650 --> 04:41.180
You're too serious, Master.

04:43.510 --> 04:44.430
Enter.

04:45.570 --> 04:48.800
Good, you're back, Ike-sama!

04:48.800 --> 04:49.880
What happened?

04:49.880 --> 04:51.770
Big trouble!

04:52.220 --> 04:55.480
The Alliance of Kings 
started an all-out attack!

05:02.850 --> 05:04.320
This is...

05:04.960 --> 05:06.470
They got us here, too?

05:06.470 --> 05:07.570
Yes.

05:07.570 --> 05:12.520
But, and this is hard to 
believe... a girl saved us!

05:12.520 --> 05:13.540
A girl?

05:13.800 --> 05:16.160
She was incredibly strong, this young girl!

05:16.160 --> 05:18.980
She took out all the enemies on her own!

05:21.270 --> 05:22.890
So that's what happened.

05:23.760 --> 05:28.960
Jiron, I'm heading to Alesta immediately 
to support Cefiro-sama's army.

05:28.960 --> 05:29.580
Yes, sir.

05:30.220 --> 05:32.680
How many forces do we 
have available right now?

05:33.210 --> 05:36.250
Around 100 were wounded in the last battle.

05:36.250 --> 05:39.440
So we only have around 500 at the moment.

05:40.630 --> 05:45.400
And we need to leave a 
minimum of forces here...

05:45.400 --> 05:48.070
So I think we actually have even less.

05:48.330 --> 05:49.450
I see.

05:49.450 --> 05:51.440
Um, how many does the enemy have?

05:51.440 --> 05:52.630
Five thousand.

05:52.630 --> 05:54.790
Do we have a chance?

05:55.160 --> 06:00.250
Gamos, Beio, Kushana and their respective 
brigades are all fighting in other areas.

06:00.840 --> 06:02.710
We have to do it alone.

06:04.200 --> 06:05.480
Excuse me.

06:08.010 --> 06:09.150
Gunther-sama!

06:10.180 --> 06:13.180
I think I'll be able to repay my debt to you.

06:14.920 --> 06:20.220
The guns you've made have
 already more than repaid us.

06:20.220 --> 06:22.850
I'm not the one who makes the guns.

06:22.850 --> 06:24.900
They're made by dwarven craftsmen.

06:25.230 --> 06:29.700
But there are dwarven warriors in 
this city as well as craftsmen.

06:29.700 --> 06:31.370
Around a hundred.

06:31.920 --> 06:35.870
They'll serve you well in battle.

06:35.870 --> 06:37.410
Are you sure?

06:37.410 --> 06:40.330
This battle has nothing 
to do with the dwarves.

06:41.150 --> 06:45.440
No... if the Demon Lord's army 
wins and unifies the world,

06:45.440 --> 06:48.180
they'll make a country for us dwarves, right?

06:48.180 --> 06:51.630
That, I can promise by my name.

06:51.630 --> 06:54.810
But the Demon Lord's army 
is struggling right now.

06:54.810 --> 06:58.270
We may not be able to fulfill that promise.

06:58.270 --> 07:00.360
If that happens, it happens.

07:00.360 --> 07:04.730
It will mean I made an error in 
my judgment, and nothing more.

07:06.690 --> 07:11.820
You've given a home all the dwarves 
who were wandering the land.

07:12.460 --> 07:16.160
If nothing else, I need 
to repay you for that.

07:16.620 --> 07:20.620
The dwarves are a race 
that never forgets a debt!

07:25.080 --> 07:27.420
I thank you for your help.

07:28.240 --> 07:29.230
Ike-sama.

07:32.560 --> 07:34.610
Let us help, too.

07:34.610 --> 07:36.510
We'll go with you.

07:36.510 --> 07:38.180
Please!

07:38.180 --> 07:40.480
Don't you dare suggest 
you could fight, humans!

07:40.480 --> 07:44.060
We don't know how long this war will last!

07:44.520 --> 07:47.760
We have to protect our own lives ourselves!

07:47.760 --> 07:49.190
That's what I think!

07:50.050 --> 07:51.270
Are you sure?

07:51.270 --> 07:53.150
We're the Demon Lord's army!

07:53.150 --> 07:54.280
Ike-sama?

07:54.560 --> 07:58.190
Our last ruler levied 
impossible taxes on us.

07:58.190 --> 08:01.000
We were all at the point of breaking.

08:01.440 --> 08:05.200
But since you took over this town,

08:05.200 --> 08:08.210
we've become many times more
prosperous than we were before.

08:08.480 --> 08:15.430
And during the last attack, your soldiers 
sacrificed themselves to protect us!

08:15.760 --> 08:22.720
Without your help, we would've 
starved or become bandits.

08:22.720 --> 08:25.280
Please give us a chance to repay you!

08:25.280 --> 08:26.400
Please!

08:26.880 --> 08:30.480
Ike-sama! Demons can't accept human help!

08:31.640 --> 08:32.480
Oink!

08:32.480 --> 08:33.820
That's so mean, oink!

08:34.110 --> 08:36.090
Stop oinking up the place.

08:36.090 --> 08:38.910
Since when do you get to 
tell Ike-sama what to do?

08:38.910 --> 08:40.270
You're way too ugly!

08:40.270 --> 08:40.860
Oink!

08:40.860 --> 08:42.010
That's right!

08:42.010 --> 08:43.020
Oink!

08:42.010 --> 08:45.450
I'm sure Master has some plan!

08:45.450 --> 08:46.160
Oink!

08:46.160 --> 08:50.110
Somebody as ugly as you has no 
business telling Ike-sama what to do!

08:50.110 --> 08:50.940
Oink!

08:50.940 --> 08:52.360
That's right!

08:52.360 --> 08:56.220
You don't even know what kind of deep 
thoughts are going through his head!

08:56.220 --> 08:57.580
So apologize!

08:57.580 --> 08:58.800
I'm sorry!

09:01.580 --> 09:04.730
I'm happy you all feel that way.

09:04.730 --> 09:07.450
We'll split our forces in two, then.

09:07.450 --> 09:10.160
One force will go to Alesta with us.

09:10.160 --> 09:13.810
The other will stay here to protect Ivalias.

09:15.640 --> 09:18.660
And I want to ask something 
from those who stay.

09:18.960 --> 09:21.120
Anything you need!

09:21.440 --> 09:26.590
The Alliance of Kings may attack 
once more while we're gone.

09:27.120 --> 09:30.340
When that happens, surrender, do not fight.

09:33.170 --> 09:34.800
B-But...

09:35.120 --> 09:39.010
If they think you're working with 
demons, they'll punish you harshly.

09:39.010 --> 09:40.760
They may execute you.

09:41.200 --> 09:43.100
I do not want that.

09:43.700 --> 09:44.730
Ike-sama.

09:45.290 --> 09:46.440
I say this again.

09:47.030 --> 09:49.690
Do not resist uselessly.

10:05.990 --> 10:09.460
It's a four-day march to Alesta over land.

10:11.380 --> 10:14.870
<i>Thanks to everyone's help, 
the brigade has grown in size.</i>

10:15.840 --> 10:19.790
<i>But the enemy still has us 
badly outnumbered.</i>

10:21.260 --> 10:24.950
<i>I need to think of some kind 
of tactic on the way there.</i>

10:25.550 --> 10:30.330
<i>I hope Cefiro-sama can 
hold out until we arrive.</i>

10:41.870 --> 10:43.940
Our lines have fallen apart!

10:44.560 --> 10:46.070
Push them back!

10:56.940 --> 10:59.210
<i>We're vastly outnumbered.</i>

10:59.210 --> 11:00.340
<i>We're slowly losing.</i>

11:01.850 --> 11:06.560
<i>If we can't separate the enemies inside 
from those outside, we'll be crushed.</i>

11:07.090 --> 11:10.770
<i>Can I use Meteo Schlagen?</i>

11:13.860 --> 11:17.820
<i>If I use magic now, 
the orcs will be caught up in it.</i>

11:19.550 --> 11:22.110
<i>I need to get to where 
I can see the soldiers outside.</i>

11:29.870 --> 11:33.620
You're not the only one 
who can use Explodiren.

11:33.620 --> 11:34.630
Surround her.

11:34.630 --> 11:35.980
Weaklings!

11:45.820 --> 11:47.350
You won't escape!

11:55.260 --> 11:56.190
Damn it!

12:10.990 --> 12:14.460
Hang in there, 
just a little while longer.

12:18.080 --> 12:20.620
Darker than the blackest star...

12:20.620 --> 12:22.380
Within the depths of true darkness...

12:22.880 --> 12:25.890
When the star of the heavenly wolf 
shines, stained with crimson...

12:26.910 --> 12:30.620
A calamitous white light that brings 
this world to the next one...

12:31.840 --> 12:34.410
Answer my holy demand.

12:34.410 --> 12:35.620
Meteo...

13:29.620 --> 13:32.950
Hey, how much do you 
think orc teeth sell for?

13:32.950 --> 13:38.190
I don't know, but you'd probably get 
more money for their hearts, right?

13:39.340 --> 13:41.150
You bastards...

13:41.150 --> 13:42.400
Wh-What?

13:52.960 --> 13:54.540
Die! Die!

13:54.540 --> 13:57.470
I'll kill every last demon in the world!

14:01.500 --> 14:03.740
Burn! Burn!

14:29.010 --> 14:30.400
Is she dead?

14:30.400 --> 14:32.160
She's still alive.

14:32.160 --> 14:35.000
Demons are tough.

14:35.000 --> 14:37.480
You can kill her immediately, if you want.

14:40.720 --> 14:42.810
You must not think much of me.

14:43.440 --> 14:48.990
A weakling like you could never kill me.

14:50.740 --> 14:54.450
This is Cefiro, the commander 
of the Demon Lord's 7th Corps.

14:55.500 --> 14:58.910
High Commander of the 
Red Dragon Division, E Rudle.

14:59.180 --> 15:01.150
We've met before.

15:01.910 --> 15:05.340
Oh, have we?

15:16.250 --> 15:19.320
Retreat! Retreat!

15:20.490 --> 15:22.450
You get to survive.

15:24.400 --> 15:26.700
Some other time, then.

15:28.450 --> 15:34.480
I'm sure if I killed you then, I wouldn't 
find myself humiliated like this.

15:35.170 --> 15:38.410
I've heard that one of 
your men is very talented.

15:40.080 --> 15:43.830
I'm sure he won't leave you like this.

15:43.830 --> 15:47.000
Was that your plan from the start?!

15:47.000 --> 15:52.970
I've been ordered to annihilate 
you and the rest of the 7th Corps.

15:54.890 --> 15:55.930
Kill me!

15:55.930 --> 15:58.840
I can't take this humiliation!

15:58.840 --> 16:00.900
Just kill me now!

16:02.160 --> 16:03.580
Wait, E Rudle!

16:05.790 --> 16:10.830
I'll guarantee your safety until 
the day of the mission.

16:19.200 --> 16:20.180
Ike...

16:22.000 --> 16:23.160
I'm sorry.

17:41.190 --> 17:43.450
Ike-dono, I'm coming in.

17:43.720 --> 17:44.840
Gunther-sama.

17:47.690 --> 17:50.670
The demons and humans are quickly 
learning to fight cohesively,

17:50.670 --> 17:52.340
despite the short amount
 of time they've trained.

17:52.340 --> 17:54.340
And our prototype weapons are all set.

17:54.680 --> 17:56.620
I appreciate it.

17:56.620 --> 17:57.550
No, no.

17:58.240 --> 18:00.680
I'm just on edge, is all.

18:01.240 --> 18:05.270
It's a head-on fight with the 
humans this time, after all.

18:05.610 --> 18:11.290
So, not to hurry you, but when 
is the attack order coming?

18:11.290 --> 18:14.730
The situation is still dire.

18:14.730 --> 18:18.050
I sent Jiron to do recon 
early this morning.

18:18.050 --> 18:21.200
When his report comes in, 
we'll hold a conference.

18:24.390 --> 18:25.830
Walk softly.

18:25.830 --> 18:27.630
If the enemy sees us, we're done for.

18:27.630 --> 18:28.310
Ugah!

18:28.310 --> 18:29.550
Don't say "Ugah!"

18:29.550 --> 18:31.810
I said, walk quietly!

18:31.810 --> 18:32.670
Ugah!

18:33.870 --> 18:35.940
Sheesh...

18:37.150 --> 18:39.280
What does "Ugah" even mean? Oink. Oink.

18:39.280 --> 18:40.670
Ugah. Ugah. Oink. Oink.

18:41.370 --> 18:44.700
Now, how are the castle walls holding up?

18:46.060 --> 18:47.520
Th-That's...

18:53.900 --> 18:58.280
Where'd that ugly pig run off to?

18:58.280 --> 19:02.080
My nails and skin are a mess after 
sleeping outside so many nights.

19:02.080 --> 19:07.580
I can't wait to end this war and suck all 
the life energy from those loser men.

19:08.730 --> 19:10.870
Wh-What's wrong, ugly pig?

19:10.870 --> 19:14.030
If you're back, you should say so.

19:14.030 --> 19:16.040
Ike-sama, the pig—

19:16.040 --> 19:17.590
I mean...

19:17.590 --> 19:19.830
Jiron is back.

19:20.580 --> 19:22.010
You're back, Jiron?

19:22.010 --> 19:24.010
So, what's the situation in Alesta?

19:24.490 --> 19:27.470
Well, um...

19:50.760 --> 19:53.900
Wh-What do we do, Ike-sama?

19:54.420 --> 19:56.990
Hey, what do you see?

19:56.990 --> 19:59.260
Tell me, ugly pig!

19:59.260 --> 20:00.300
Oink, oink!

20:00.590 --> 20:03.360
Quit oinking and spit it out!

20:03.360 --> 20:06.050
It may be best if you don't look, missy.

20:06.930 --> 20:09.470
So, what do we do, Ike-dono?

20:11.920 --> 20:15.190
Gunther-sama, there's something I've learned.

20:15.960 --> 20:18.150
Cefiro-sama is alive.

20:20.070 --> 20:24.460
We rushed here, believing 
the Demon Lord's words.

20:24.460 --> 20:27.280
But there was something I was afraid of.

20:27.280 --> 20:33.250
I feared that Cefiro-sama 
might have already been slain.

20:33.920 --> 20:38.860
I see. But isn't it also possible 
that that scarecrow was

20:38.860 --> 20:43.720
put up there to make you think 
she's alive when she isn't?

20:43.720 --> 20:48.720
It's not easy to get the supplies 
needed to feed five thousand troops.

20:48.720 --> 20:51.580
They'll want to end this soon.

20:51.580 --> 20:54.610
Do you know what they're saying?

20:52.030 --> 20:56.980
They have to deal with 
Beio, Gamos, and Kushana, too.

20:54.610 --> 20:56.250
Nope.

20:56.980 --> 20:57.600
Jiron.

20:57.600 --> 20:59.150
Y-Yes?

20:59.150 --> 21:01.100
What's the name of the enemy general?

21:01.100 --> 21:06.110
Um, it's E Rudle, 
Commander of the Red Dragon Division.

21:07.350 --> 21:11.030
E Rudle. I've heard he's incredibly talented.

21:11.030 --> 21:16.120
If he wants to annihilate 
me and the other brigades,

21:16.120 --> 21:20.120
it wouldn't make sense to kill Cefiro-sama 
when she could be used as bait.

21:21.090 --> 21:24.770
But we don't know her current state..

21:24.770 --> 21:27.540
She may be too wounded to move.

21:27.540 --> 21:32.560
Which means, even if we know it's 
a trap, we still have to attack?

21:32.560 --> 21:36.610
Yes. We need to move fast.

21:36.610 --> 21:39.520
I'll describe our strategy at the conference.

21:39.950 --> 21:41.510
And Gunther-sama...

21:43.000 --> 21:45.450
I'd like your help.

21:46.580 --> 21:47.660
Of course.

21:48.430 --> 21:49.820
Lilith! Jiron!

21:50.370 --> 21:52.830
I want your help, too.

21:54.160 --> 21:55.540
You can count on us!

21:56.220 --> 22:01.070
Okay! We'll launch our attack at dawn!

22:01.070 --> 22:02.580
Yeah!

23:34.350 --> 23:38.930
<i>General E Rudle</i>
